1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 8=

10
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:00,860
(Imperial Medical Service)
An epidemic has suddenly broken out

11
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:01,999
(Imperial Medical Service)
in the Capital region.

12
00:01:02,070 --> 00:01:03,110
It's spreading at an alarming rate.

13
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:06,150
The people are in grave danger.

14
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:09,150
But the symptoms
of this epidemic are unusual,

15
00:01:09,310 --> 00:01:10,820
and the illness progresses
dangerously fast.

16
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,790
None of us has a reliable treatment.

17
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:17,750
Though Medical Attendant Gu is a woman,

18
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:19,330
she has repeatedly
devised remarkable treatments

19
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:20,570
and cured patients
of stubborn illnesses.

20
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:22,990
Her medical expertise
is plain for all to see.

21
00:01:23,310 --> 00:01:24,150
- Indeed.
- That's right.

22
00:01:24,150 --> 00:01:25,950
After careful consideration,

23
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:28,600
I believe this crucial task
of fighting the epidemic

24
00:01:29,070 --> 00:01:31,430
can only be entrusted
to Medical Attendant Gu.

25
00:01:31,430 --> 00:01:32,540
- Agreed.
- Indeed.

26
00:01:33,670 --> 00:01:36,390
Cui Hong has been secretly colluding
with tribes along the border

27
00:01:36,790 --> 00:01:37,710
to smuggle medicinal herbs.

28
00:01:38,860 --> 00:01:40,500
His cousin Liu Xian in Jiangnan

29
00:01:41,250 --> 00:01:42,640
is responsible
for securing the trade routes.

30
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:44,710
(Enemies are attacking our borders,)

31
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,999
(and now an epidemic
has broken out in the Capital region.)

32
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:48,580
(I suspect)

33
00:01:48,860 --> 00:01:50,390
(Cui Hong has a hand in all of this.)

34
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:53,670
Director, you are absolutely right.

35
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:56,500
Medical Attendant Gu
even cured Censor Zheng's daughter

36
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:57,670
of such a serious illness.

37
00:01:57,980 --> 00:01:58,900
Surely an epidemic like this

38
00:01:59,030 --> 00:02:01,060
will pose no difficulty for her.

39
00:02:01,470 --> 00:02:03,620
Medical Attendant Gu's
medical skills are indeed exceptional.

40
00:02:04,510 --> 00:02:06,700
But the epidemic zone
is extremely dangerous,

41
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,280
and the disease is highly contagious.

42
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:11,590
Medical Attendant Gu
is a woman, after all.

43
00:02:12,390 --> 00:02:13,700
If she is afraid to go,

44
00:02:14,030 --> 00:02:15,420
we should be understanding

45
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:17,110
and consider another solution.

46
00:02:17,620 --> 00:02:19,310
(They all speak with such certainty,)

47
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,690
(yet none of them
dares risk their own life.)

48
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:22,340
(Then I'll turn this to my advantage)

49
00:02:22,340 --> 00:02:23,410
(and take control of the situation.)

50
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:27,340
A physician's duty is to save lives.

51
00:02:28,230 --> 00:02:29,590
I am willing to go to the epidemic zone

52
00:02:29,590 --> 00:02:30,420
and treat the people there.

53
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:35,510
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

54
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:38,140
Medical Attendant Gu has truly
put the people before herself.

55
00:02:38,140 --> 00:02:39,870
The people are fortunate to have you.

56
00:02:41,010 --> 00:02:42,640
Then we shall entrust
this task to Medical Attendant Gu.

57
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,700
Set out for
the epidemic zone immediately

58
00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:46,340
and take charge
of the treatment efforts.

59
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:50,380
(Imperial Medical Service)

60
00:02:50,390 --> 00:02:51,310
Medical Attendant Gu.

61
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:54,870
Hanyi, something terrible has happened.

62
00:02:55,590 --> 00:02:56,260
Zheng Shu.

63
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,590
What has you so alarmed?

64
00:02:58,900 --> 00:03:00,950
An epidemic has broken out
in several villages outside the Capital.

65
00:03:01,290 --> 00:03:02,820
It's more dangerous
than anything we've seen before.

66
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:05,740
I wanted to visit my cousin
in one of the villages,

67
00:03:06,230 --> 00:03:07,790
but Father strictly forbade it

68
00:03:07,980 --> 00:03:09,110
and won't let me leave the city.

69
00:03:10,260 --> 00:03:11,860
I'm on my way to the epidemic zone

70
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:12,860
to treat the people there.

71
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:14,350
Hanyi,

72
00:03:15,070 --> 00:03:16,300
that's exactly why I came to warn you.

73
00:03:16,730 --> 00:03:17,950
There's more to this than meets the eye.

74
00:03:18,230 --> 00:03:19,630
Don't get caught up in it.

75
00:03:21,110 --> 00:03:22,070
What do you mean?

76
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:25,860
This epidemic appeared
under very suspicious circumstances,

77
00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:27,910
yet the court
has issued no notice at all,

78
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:30,390
and not a word of it
has spread through the Capital.

79
00:03:31,190 --> 00:03:33,630
Do you know why?

80
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:40,140
Someone is deliberately covering it up.

81
00:03:41,980 --> 00:03:44,420
Father said
it was Grand Secretary Cui Hong.

82
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:48,300
He wants to use this to bring down
Lord Ju of the Ministry of Works.

83
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:50,580
He plans to blame
the source of the epidemic

84
00:03:50,830 --> 00:03:52,740
on the riverworks overseen by Lord Ju.

85
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:55,950
(Just as I suspected.)

86
00:03:58,110 --> 00:03:58,790
Hanyi,

87
00:04:00,070 --> 00:04:00,950
don't go.

88
00:04:03,190 --> 00:04:04,020
I'm a physician.

89
00:04:04,230 --> 00:04:05,510
How could I stand by and let people die?

90
00:04:06,110 --> 00:04:07,580
You can go and save them,

91
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:09,630
but you must remember,

92
00:04:10,070 --> 00:04:12,420
don't get drawn
into this dangerous struggle.

93
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:16,070
Thank you, Zheng Shu.

94
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:17,830
I know what to do.

95
00:04:29,740 --> 00:04:30,110
Stop!

96
00:04:30,790 --> 00:04:32,420
This is a restricted
epidemic zone. Leave at once!

97
00:04:33,260 --> 00:04:35,510
I am Medical Attendant Gu Hanyi,
sent by the Imperial Medical Service.

98
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:36,700
I've come to treat the patients.

99
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:39,540
A female medical attendant?

100
00:04:40,140 --> 00:04:40,860
We have orders

101
00:04:41,230 --> 00:04:42,540
to burn the entire epidemic zone

102
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:45,020
in three days to prevent
disease from spreading.

103
00:04:45,670 --> 00:04:46,700
If you go in now,

104
00:04:46,750 --> 00:04:47,960
you're walking straight to your death.

105
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:49,230
Burn it?

106
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:51,540
There are still
so many people alive in there.

107
00:04:51,950 --> 00:04:52,670
What you're doing

108
00:04:52,810 --> 00:04:53,870
is no different from killing them.

109
00:04:53,830 --> 00:04:54,510
Enough!

110
00:04:54,980 --> 00:04:56,070
Those are strict orders from above.

111
00:04:56,420 --> 00:04:57,390
Either leave at once,

112
00:04:57,580 --> 00:04:58,860
or go in and wait to die with them.

113
00:05:00,790 --> 00:05:01,860
An imperial edict.

114
00:05:05,980 --> 00:05:08,630
By the will of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees.

115
00:05:09,140 --> 00:05:11,260
An epidemic is raging
throughout the Capital region,

116
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:12,630
and I am deeply concerned.

117
00:05:13,220 --> 00:05:15,660
I hereby dispatch Medical Attendant
Gu Hanyi to treat the afflicted

118
00:05:15,950 --> 00:05:17,780
and appoint Xie Yungui
as Imperial Commissioner

119
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,420
with full authority
over all epidemic control measures.

120
00:05:19,650 --> 00:05:20,530
It is hereby decreed that

121
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:22,020
Medical Attendant Gu Hanyi

122
00:05:22,700 --> 00:05:24,550
shall eradicate
the epidemic within ten days.

123
00:05:25,310 --> 00:05:25,900
If she succeeds,

124
00:05:26,780 --> 00:05:28,190
the court shall reward her handsomely.

125
00:05:30,090 --> 00:05:31,320
If the epidemic persists after ten days,

126
00:05:34,650 --> 00:05:36,170
she shall never be permitted
to leave the epidemic zone.

127
00:05:37,630 --> 00:05:38,310
Respect this decree.

128
00:05:43,430 --> 00:05:46,020
I, Gu Hanyi, humbly accept
the decree with gratitude.

129
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:50,260
(Epidemics)

130
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:53,070
(usually present
with fever and coughing up blood,)

131
00:05:53,660 --> 00:05:54,580
(skin ulceration,)

132
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:58,630
(and are often caused by accumulated
damp toxins or invading pestilential qi.)

133
00:06:00,070 --> 00:06:01,340
(But these people before me...)

134
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:03,140
(Something is wrong.)

135
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,460
(Their high fevers won't subside,)

136
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:05,340
(their limbs are ice cold,)

137
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:07,310
(and they're not
coughing up bloody phlegm,)

138
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:08,990
(but foul-smelling black froth.)

139
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:10,550
(Even stranger,)

140
00:06:11,220 --> 00:06:13,310
(their pupils are unfocused
and their minds clouded.)

141
00:06:13,650 --> 00:06:14,800
Divide the area into separate
treatment zones immediately.

142
00:06:15,070 --> 00:06:16,190
Keep mild and severe cases apart.

143
00:06:16,780 --> 00:06:18,780
Make sure everyone
receives enough food and water.

144
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:20,430
Maintain basic order here.

145
00:06:20,700 --> 00:06:21,750
- Yes, Sir.
- Yes, Sir.

146
00:06:23,700 --> 00:06:25,310
(This isn't
a naturally occurring epidemic.)

147
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,820
(They've been deliberately poisoned.)

148
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:29,140
(Who is using an epidemic as a pretext)

149
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,260
(to wipe out an entire city?)

150
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:31,550
(Cui Hong.)

151
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,360
(You would even
use the lives of the people)

152
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,580
(as pieces in your game.)

153
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,660
(Father once told me,)

154
00:06:40,550 --> 00:06:42,950
(Epidemics have many causes,
and poisons take countless forms.)

155
00:06:43,770 --> 00:06:45,240
(If you see fever
and simply use cooling remedies,)

156
00:06:45,340 --> 00:06:46,510
(you'll only make matters worse.)

157
00:06:47,460 --> 00:06:49,870
(A physician
must look beyond the symptoms)

158
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:53,780
(to find the source of the poison
and understand its course.)

159
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:57,440
(Cui Hong didn't spread
the epidemic merely to kill.)

160
00:06:57,530 --> 00:06:58,650
(His true aim was to clear the area.)

161
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:01,880
(The epidemic zone south of the city falls
under Lord Ju's jurisdiction.)

162
00:07:02,070 --> 00:07:03,310
(If the epidemic cannot be contained,)

163
00:07:03,510 --> 00:07:05,580
(he can hold Lord Ju
responsible for mishandling it)

164
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:09,220
(while lining his own pockets
through medicinal supply purchases.)

165
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:10,750
(Cui Hong.)

166
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:12,990
(Your scheme
to achieve two ends at once)

167
00:07:12,990 --> 00:07:14,050
(won't work as easily as you think.)

168
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:16,020
(I won't let you succeed.)

169
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:18,870
Here, take this.

170
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:19,460
Here.

171
00:07:19,950 --> 00:07:20,560
Careful, it's hot.

172
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:21,140
Slowly.

173
00:07:21,950 --> 00:07:22,460
Be careful.

174
00:07:23,990 --> 00:07:24,550
Drink it.

175
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:26,050
Drink it while it's warm.

176
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:27,140
Thank you.

177
00:07:27,460 --> 00:07:28,100
Thank you.

178
00:07:30,750 --> 00:07:31,140
Here.

179
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:37,220
Good.

180
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:52,730
- Master.
- You haven't slept in three days.

181
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:54,260
Have something to eat.

182
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:56,630
There's no time to waste.

183
00:07:57,260 --> 00:07:59,260
This epidemic is strange
and constantly changing.

184
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:01,830
Ordinary remedies
can't treat the underlying cause.

185
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:05,100
I need to find the key
to this as soon as possible.

186
00:08:13,830 --> 00:08:15,564
(Use rehmannia root, scrophularia root,
rhinoceros horn,)

187
00:08:15,564 --> 00:08:16,990
(and moutan bark
as the principal ingredients.)

188
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:20,220
(Add honeysuckle and forsythia
to dispel heat and restore the flow of qi.)

189
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,260
(Then add sweet flag and turmeric root)

190
00:08:22,260 --> 00:08:23,490
(to clear the senses
and revive consciousness.)

191
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:24,921
(Together, they form)

192
00:08:24,921 --> 00:08:26,950
(the Epidemic-Clearing
Detoxifying Decoction.)

193
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:32,510
The pulse is much steadier now.

194
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:33,780
The breathing is smoother too.

195
00:08:34,090 --> 00:08:35,170
And you look much more alert.

196
00:08:35,780 --> 00:08:37,070
Thank you, Medical Attendant Gu.

197
00:08:37,750 --> 00:08:38,580
The prescription is working.

198
00:08:38,950 --> 00:08:39,750
You'll recover soon.

199
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:44,900
Master.

200
00:08:45,190 --> 00:08:46,220
Is the next batch almost ready?

201
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:51,630
Master.

202
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:53,550
Master, what's wrong?

203
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:27,460
The red one is the antidote.

204
00:09:28,140 --> 00:09:29,270
It can counter nearly any poison.

205
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:30,790
When the need arises,

206
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:32,670
it can save a life.

207
00:09:36,070 --> 00:09:36,670
(Master.)

208
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:38,740
(Please wake up.)

209
00:09:39,580 --> 00:09:40,860
(I'm begging you, please wake up.)

210
00:09:51,910 --> 00:09:52,380
Master.

211
00:09:53,460 --> 00:09:54,070
You're awake.

212
00:09:54,950 --> 00:09:55,340
How are you?

213
00:09:55,830 --> 00:09:56,860
How do you feel?

214
00:09:59,070 --> 00:09:59,620
Your hand...

215
00:10:00,950 --> 00:10:01,830
How did you hurt it?

216
00:10:02,580 --> 00:10:04,100
Just a small cut. It's nothing.

217
00:10:05,070 --> 00:10:05,740
Are you hungry?

218
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:07,310
I'll get you something to eat.

219
00:10:16,430 --> 00:10:17,220
Medical Attendant Gu.

220
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:19,270
- Medical Attendant Gu.
- Medical Attendant Gu.

221
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:21,220
You have saved countless lives

222
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:22,310
with your skill and compassion.

223
00:10:22,700 --> 00:10:24,100
We are but humble commoners,

224
00:10:24,700 --> 00:10:25,550
yet you

225
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:27,460
brought us all back
from the brink of death.

226
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:29,190
Please accept our respects.

227
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:32,310
- Thank you for saving our lives.
- Thank you for saving our lives.

228
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:33,270
Please, get up.

229
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:34,340
Please get up.

230
00:10:34,830 --> 00:10:35,700
Everyone, please get up.

231
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,310
I merely fulfilled the duty

232
00:10:40,310 --> 00:10:41,550
of a physician.

233
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:43,220
Overcoming this epidemic

234
00:10:43,740 --> 00:10:44,910
was not my achievement alone.

235
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:47,270
Every one of you

236
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:49,460
held on through your own
determination to survive

237
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:50,700
and endured until the end.

238
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:52,740
It was all of us together

239
00:10:53,910 --> 00:10:55,100
who overcame this disaster.

240
00:10:55,830 --> 00:10:58,190
- Thank you, Divine Physician Gu.
- Thank you, Divine Physician Gu.

241
00:10:59,150 --> 00:11:00,670
Everyone, you may go now.

242
00:11:16,910 --> 00:11:18,500
That Gu Hanyi

243
00:11:19,980 --> 00:11:22,430
actually managed to find a way out

244
00:11:23,310 --> 00:11:24,980
of a seemingly hopeless situation.

245
00:11:26,460 --> 00:11:27,530
She is highly skilled in medicine,

246
00:11:27,910 --> 00:11:29,190
but she cannot be brought to our side.

247
00:11:29,670 --> 00:11:31,580
If she reports what happened
in Yongning Ward to His Majesty,

248
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:32,910
Sir,

249
00:11:33,430 --> 00:11:34,950
allow me to eliminate her

250
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,320
and remove the threat for good.

251
00:11:40,340 --> 00:11:42,030
Xie Yungui is behind her.

252
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:45,460
He once saved His Majesty's life.

253
00:11:45,460 --> 00:11:46,460
If we move against her now,

254
00:11:47,190 --> 00:11:49,580
we would only incur His Majesty's wrath.

255
00:11:50,670 --> 00:11:51,670
I failed to consider that.

256
00:11:54,030 --> 00:11:55,430
But we still cannot underestimate her.

257
00:11:57,380 --> 00:11:58,830
She has thwarted
my plans time and again.

258
00:12:01,670 --> 00:12:03,340
It's time she learned a lesson.

259
00:12:04,670 --> 00:12:05,670
Make the arrangements at once.

260
00:12:05,860 --> 00:12:06,830
Have our people

261
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:09,070
give her a proper warning.

262
00:12:26,790 --> 00:12:29,650
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

263
00:12:30,410 --> 00:12:33,350
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

264
00:12:34,010 --> 00:12:36,830
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

265
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:40,670
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

266
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:44,840
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

267
00:12:45,180 --> 00:12:48,470
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

268
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:55,300
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

269
00:12:56,090 --> 00:13:03,180
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

270
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:13,530
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

271
00:13:13,830 --> 00:13:15,640
♪I stand here today♪

272
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:20,290
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

273
00:13:20,290 --> 00:13:27,780
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

274
00:13:28,420 --> 00:13:29,710
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

275
00:13:29,710 --> 00:13:32,110
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

276
00:13:32,550 --> 00:13:39,400
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
